Package: iQualityR
Type: Package
Title: Integrated Quality Engineering Framework
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Zhiming", family = "Chen", email = "zhimingc383@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Zhiming Chen [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Zhiming Chen <zhimingc383@gmail.com>
Description: A meta-package that installs and loads the complete iQualityR
    quality engineering framework. It brings together ten cooperating packages
    covering core infrastructure (iQualityR.core), statistical foundations
    (iQualityR.stat), visualization (iQualityR.plot), measurement system
    analysis (iQualityR.msa), process capability (iQualityR.capa), design of
    experiments (iQualityR.doe), sampling plans (iQualityR.sampling),
    reliability analysis (iQualityR.reliability), predictive quality
    modeling (iQualityR.predict), and statistical process control
    (iQualityR.spc). Loading iQualityR attaches all member packages so their
    APIs are immediately available, mirroring the tidyverse convention.
